  "title": "website referencing check Guide",
  "excerpt": "\"> 1. Author Enter the Surname and Initials or Company for the Author of the website You must enter the Author Author Surname or Company Name * Author…",
  "content": "<div class=\"entry-content\" itemprop=\"mainContentOfPage\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section mcb-section   \"  style=\"padding-top:0px; padding-bottom:0px; background-color:\" ><div class=\"section_wrapper mcb-section-inner\"><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap one  valign-top clearfix\" style=\"\"  ><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column one column_column \"><div class=\"column_attr clearfix\"  style=\"\"><h1></h1>\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"<?php include(ABSPATH . '/betheme/includes/website-reference.php'); ?>\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <div id=\"well-author\" class=\"well\">\n                        <label><span>1.</span> Author</label>\n                        <div id=\"author-info\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Enter the Surname and Initials or Company for the Author of the website</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"author-alert\" class=\"alert-msg\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> You must enter the Author</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                                <label for=\"author\">Author Surname or Company Name *</label>\n                                <input name=\"author\" type=\"text\" class=\"form-control validate\" id=\"author\" placeholder=\"e.g. Hawking\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                                <label for=\"author_i\">Author Initial(s)</label>\n                                <input name=\"author_i\" type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"author_i\" placeholder=\"e.g. S\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"well-sitetitle\" class=\"well\">\n                        <label for=\"sitetitle\"><span>2.</span> Website Title *</label>\n                        <div id=\"sitetitle-info\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Enter the full title of the website or page</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"sitetitle-alert\" class=\"alert-msg\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> You must enter the title of the website or webpage that you wish to reference</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <input name=\"sitetitle\" type=\"text\" class=\"form-control validate\" id=\"sitetitle\" placeholder=\"e.g. Professor Stephen Hawking's website\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"well-year\" class=\"well\">\n                        <label for=\"year\"><span>3.</span> Year of publication *</label>\n                        <div id=\"year-info\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Enter the year the website was published in YYYY format. If you only know the year of Copyright then enter a \"c\" before the year eg: c2015</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"year-alert\" class=\"alert-msg\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> No date was entered. Harvard requires [no date] be entered if the Year of publication is not known. If you wish to use [no date] then scroll down and click on Create Reference again to create a reference without a publication date. Alternatively enter the year of publication in YYYY format.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <input class=\"form-control validate\" type=\"text\" name=\"year\" id=\"year\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"well-accessed\" class=\"well\">\n                        <label for=\"accessed\"><span>4.</span> Date Accessed *</label>\n                        <div id=\"accessed-info\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Enter the date you accessed the website</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"accessed-alert\" class=\"alert-msg\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> No date was entered. You need to enter the date that you accessed the website e.g. 24 December 2016</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <input class=\"form-control validate\" type=\"text\" name=\"accessed\" id=\"accessed\" value=\"24 December 2016\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"well-url\" class=\"well\">\n                        <label for=\"url\"><span>5.</span> URL *</label>\n                        <div id=\"url-info\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Enter the full URL of the website including the \"http://\"</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"url-alert\" class=\"alert-msg\">\n                            <p><i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> Enter the URL of the website you wish to reference</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <input class=\"form-control validate-url\" type=\"text\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" placeholder=\"e.g. http://www.hawking.org.uk/\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"well\">\n                        <label for=\"generate_website\">Create Reference</label>\n                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i> Click the button below to generate your Harvard Website Reference and In-line Citation. Don't worry, you can come back and edit the reference if you need to correct or add any information</p>\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-submit\" name=\"generate_website\" value=\"Generate Website Reference\"> <i class=\"fa fa-cog\"></i> Generate Website Reference </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section the_content no_content\"><div class=\"section_wrapper\"><div class=\"the_content_wrapper\"></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>",
